  <summary>GitHub alert blockquotes (&gt; [!NOTE] and friends) rendered as Starlight asides, with the cases that stay plain blockquotes.</summary>
  <content type="html">

&lt;span id=&quot;github-alerts&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This site sets &lt;code dir=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;githubAlerts: true&lt;/code&gt;, so a blockquote that opens with one of
GitHub’s five alert markers renders as the matching Starlight aside. The same
file reads correctly on GitHub, which renders the markers itself. This page is
also the fixture the accessibility lane scans in light and dark mode.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;the-five-alert-types&quot;&gt;The five alert types&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;aside aria-label=&quot;Note&quot; class=&quot;starlight-aside starlight-aside--note&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;starlight-aside__title&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;svg viewBox=&quot;0 0 24 24&quot; width=&quot;16&quot; height=&quot;16&quot; fill=&quot;currentColor&quot; class=&quot;starlight-aside__icon&quot;&gt;&lt;path d=&quot;M12 11a1 1 0 0 0-1 1v4a1 1 0 0 0 2 0v-4a1 1 0 0 0-1-1Zm.38-3.92a1 1 0 0 0-.76 0 1 1 0 0 0-.33.21 1.15 1.15 0 0 0-.21.33 1 1 0 0 0 .21 1.09c.097.088.209.16.33.21A1 1 0 0 0 13 8a1.05 1.05 0 0 0-.29-.71 1 1 0 0 0-.33-.21ZM12 2a10 10 0 1 0 0 20 10 10 0 0 0 0-20Zm0 18a8 8 0 1 1 0-16.001A8 8 0 0 1 12 20Z&quot;&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;Note&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;starlight-aside__content&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Useful information that readers should know, even when skimming.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/aside&gt;
&lt;aside aria-label=&quot;Tip&quot; class=&quot;starlight-aside starlight-aside--tip&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;starlight-aside__title&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;svg viewBox=&quot;0 0 24 24&quot; width=&quot;16&quot; height=&quot;16&quot; fill=&quot;currentColor&quot; class=&quot;starlight-aside__icon&quot;&gt;&lt;path fill-rule=&quot;evenodd&quot; d=&quot;M1.44 8.855v-.001l3.527-3.516c.34-.344.802-.541 1.285-.548h6.649l.947-.947c3.07-3.07 6.207-3.072 7.62-2.868a1.821 1.821 0 0 1 1.557 1.557c.204 1.413.203 4.55-2.868 7.62l-.946.946v6.649a1.845 1.845 0 0 1-.549 1.286l-3.516 3.528a1.844 1.844 0 0 1-3.11-.944l-.858-4.275-4.52-4.52-2.31-.463-1.964-.394A1.847 1.847 0 0 1 .98 10.693a1.843 1.843 0 0 1 .46-1.838Zm5.379 2.017-3.873-.776L6.32 6.733h4.638l-4.14 4.14Zm8.403-5.655c2.459-2.46 4.856-2.463 5.89-2.33.134 1.035.13 3.432-2.329 5.891l-6.71 6.71-3.561-3.56 6.71-6.711Zm-1.318 15.837-.776-3.873 4.14-4.14v4.639l-3.364 3.374Z&quot; clip-rule=&quot;evenodd&quot;&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;path d=&quot;M9.318 18.345a.972.972 0 0 0-1.86-.561c-.482 1.435-1.687 2.204-2.934 2.619a8.22 8.22 0 0 1-1.23.302c.062-.365.157-.79.303-1.229.415-1.247 1.184-2.452 2.62-2.935a.971.971 0 1 0-.62-1.842c-.12.04-.236.084-.35.13-2.02.828-3.012 2.588-3.493 4.033a10.383 10.383 0 0 0-.51 2.845l-.001.016v.063c0 .536.434.972.97.972H2.24a7.21 7.21 0 0 0 .878-.065c.527-.063 1.248-.19 2.02-.447 1.445-.48 3.205-1.472 4.033-3.494a5.828 5.828 0 0 0 .147-.407Z&quot;&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;Tip&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;starlight-aside__content&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Helpful advice for doing things better or more easily.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/aside&gt;
&lt;aside aria-label=&quot;Important&quot; class=&quot;starlight-aside starlight-aside--note&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;starlight-aside__title&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;svg viewBox=&quot;0 0 24 24&quot; width=&quot;16&quot; height=&quot;16&quot; fill=&quot;currentColor&quot; class=&quot;starlight-aside__icon&quot;&gt;&lt;path d=&quot;M12 11a1 1 0 0 0-1 1v4a1 1 0 0 0 2 0v-4a1 1 0 0 0-1-1Zm.38-3.92a1 1 0 0 0-.76 0 1 1 0 0 0-.33.21 1.15 1.15 0 0 0-.21.33 1 1 0 0 0 .21 1.09c.097.088.209.16.33.21A1 1 0 0 0 13 8a1.05 1.05 0 0 0-.29-.71 1 1 0 0 0-.33-.21ZM12 2a10 10 0 1 0 0 20 10 10 0 0 0 0-20Zm0 18a8 8 0 1 1 0-16.001A8 8 0 0 1 12 20Z&quot;&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;Important&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;starlight-aside__content&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Key information readers need to achieve their goal.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/aside&gt;
&lt;aside aria-label=&quot;Warning&quot; class=&quot;starlight-aside starlight-aside--caution&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;starlight-aside__title&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;svg viewBox=&quot;0 0 24 24&quot; width=&quot;16&quot; height=&quot;16&quot; fill=&quot;currentColor&quot; class=&quot;starlight-aside__icon&quot;&gt;&lt;path d=&quot;M12 16a1 1 0 1 0 0 2 1 1 0 0 0 0-2Zm10.67 1.47-8.05-14a3 3 0 0 0-5.24 0l-8 14A3 3 0 0 0 3.94 22h16.12a3 3 0 0 0 2.61-4.53Zm-1.73 2a1 1 0 0 1-.88.51H3.94a1 1 0 0 1-.88-.51 1 1 0 0 1 0-1l8-14a1 1 0 0 1 1.78 0l8.05 14a1 1 0 0 1 .05 1.02v-.02ZM12 8a1 1 0 0 0-1 1v4a1 1 0 0 0 2 0V9a1 1 0 0 0-1-1Z&quot;&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;Warning&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;starlight-aside__content&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Urgent info that needs immediate attention to avoid problems.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/aside&gt;
&lt;aside aria-label=&quot;Caution&quot; class=&quot;starlight-aside starlight-aside--danger&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;starlight-aside__title&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;svg viewBox=&quot;0 0 24 24&quot; width=&quot;16&quot; height=&quot;16&quot; fill=&quot;currentColor&quot; class=&quot;starlight-aside__icon&quot;&gt;&lt;path d=&quot;M12 7a1 1 0 0 0-1 1v4a1 1 0 0 0 2 0V8a1 1 0 0 0-1-1Zm0 8a1 1 0 1 0 0 2 1 1 0 0 0 0-2Zm9.71-7.44-5.27-5.27a1.05 1.05 0 0 0-.71-.29H8.27a1.05 1.05 0 0 0-.71.29L2.29 7.56a1.05 1.05 0 0 0-.29.71v7.46c.004.265.107.518.29.71l5.27 5.27c.192.183.445.286.71.29h7.46a1.05 1.05 0 0 0 .71-.29l5.27-5.27a1.05 1.05 0 0 0 .29-.71V8.27a1.05 1.05 0 0 0-.29-.71ZM20 15.31 15.31 20H8.69L4 15.31V8.69L8.69 4h6.62L20 8.69v6.62Z&quot;&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;Caution&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;starlight-aside__content&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Advises about risks or negative outcomes of certain actions.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/aside&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;an-alert-with-several-blocks&quot;&gt;An alert with several blocks&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;aside aria-label=&quot;Tip&quot; class=&quot;starlight-aside starlight-aside--tip&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;starlight-aside__title&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;svg viewBox=&quot;0 0 24 24&quot; width=&quot;16&quot; height=&quot;16&quot; fill=&quot;currentColor&quot; class=&quot;starlight-aside__icon&quot;&gt;&lt;path fill-rule=&quot;evenodd&quot; d=&quot;M1.44 8.855v-.001l3.527-3.516c.34-.344.802-.541 1.285-.548h6.649l.947-.947c3.07-3.07 6.207-3.072 7.62-2.868a1.821 1.821 0 0 1 1.557 1.557c.204 1.413.203 4.55-2.868 7.62l-.946.946v6.649a1.845 1.845 0 0 1-.549 1.286l-3.516 3.528a1.844 1.844 0 0 1-3.11-.944l-.858-4.275-4.52-4.52-2.31-.463-1.964-.394A1.847 1.847 0 0 1 .98 10.693a1.843 1.843 0 0 1 .46-1.838Zm5.379 2.017-3.873-.776L6.32 6.733h4.638l-4.14 4.14Zm8.403-5.655c2.459-2.46 4.856-2.463 5.89-2.33.134 1.035.13 3.432-2.329 5.891l-6.71 6.71-3.561-3.56 6.71-6.711Zm-1.318 15.837-.776-3.873 4.14-4.14v4.639l-3.364 3.374Z&quot; clip-rule=&quot;evenodd&quot;&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;path d=&quot;M9.318 18.345a.972.972 0 0 0-1.86-.561c-.482 1.435-1.687 2.204-2.934 2.619a8.22 8.22 0 0 1-1.23.302c.062-.365.157-.79.303-1.229.415-1.247 1.184-2.452 2.62-2.935a.971.971 0 1 0-.62-1.842c-.12.04-.236.084-.35.13-2.02.828-3.012 2.588-3.493 4.033a10.383 10.383 0 0 0-.51 2.845l-.001.016v.063c0 .536.434.972.97.972H2.24a7.21 7.21 0 0 0 .878-.065c.527-.063 1.248-.19 2.02-.447 1.445-.48 3.205-1.472 4.033-3.494a5.828 5.828 0 0 0 .147-.407Z&quot;&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;Tip&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;starlight-aside__content&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;An alert body can hold more than one paragraph.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;a list item&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;and &lt;a href=&quot;/doc-kitty/guides/getting-started/&quot;&gt;a link&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/aside&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;left-as-blockquotes&quot;&gt;Left as blockquotes&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A plain blockquote is unchanged:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A plain quotation, with no marker.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;An unknown marker is not a GitHub alert type, so it stays a blockquote:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;[!DANGER]
GitHub has no DANGER alert, so neither does this site.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A marker followed by text on the same line is not an alert on GitHub either:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;[!NOTE] This line keeps its literal marker.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;</content>
